## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-time ingestion basics, per-tenant routing, idempotence, and basic observability on GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub streaming sources; Dataflow (Python) transforms
- BigQuery per-tenant tables with environmental isolation
- Idempotence via insertId; dead-letter queue handling
- Basic monitoring and dashboards for latency/cost

## Code Example
```javascript
class ValidateAndRoute {
  process(element) {
    const data = JSON.parse(element);
    if (!data.tenant_id || !data.timestamp || data.value == null) return;
    return [{ tenant: data.tenant_id, value: data.value }];
  }
}
```

